  "mathematical_divergence_argument": "For the repaired total-test minimizer, each positive test unfolds the next head search. If no zero witness exists, this persists indefinitely. Standardization rules out a normal form. The final guard keeps this search in function position; a numeral instead iterates I finitely and then evaluates E.",
